# QualityFlow intermediates (STP/STD/reviews/state). outputs/<id>/{go,python}-tests/
# stay committable so the generated tests land in the PR diff for a human reviewer.
# They are NOT reliably run by CI: the QualityFlow commits carry [skip ci], so a
# committed go-tests/ package is only compiled by `go test -race ./...` at
# merge_group time (after review), and no CI job runs the python-tests at all.
# Cross-checked against every outputs/ path in qualityflow-fullsend@f6311b4;
# re-check this list when that pin moves.
**/outputs/*/stp/
**/outputs/*/std/
**/outputs/*/reviews/
**/outputs/*/state/
